---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | VERIQON TECHNOLOGIES"
  description="VERIQON TECHNOLOGIES Terms of Service governing website usage, VERIQON ONE software evaluation, and enterprise quality engineering licensing."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />

    <header class="section-hero" style="padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; text-align: left;">
      <div class="badge">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span> Legal &amp; Governance
      </div>
      <h1 class="heading-xl" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 8px;">Effective Date: November 2026 &bull; VERIQON TECHNOLOGIES</p>
    </header>

    <div class="card legal-content" style="max-width: 900px; padding: 2.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; line-height: 1.8;">
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing this website, evaluating technical documentation, or initiating proof-of-concept deployments of <strong>VERIQON ONE</strong>, you agree to comply with these terms, our enterprise security policies, and any applicable Master Services Agreements (MSA) executed with <strong>VERIQON TECHNOLOGIES</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">2. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <p>
          All trademarks, corporate marks, logos, technical architectures, and marketing materials displayed on this website are the proprietary property of <strong>VERIQON TECHNOLOGIES</strong>. The <strong>VERIQON ONE</strong> platform, including its 7 specialist quality studios, AI reasoning models, execution runtimes, and synthesizer engines, are protected by intellectual property laws and international treaties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">3. Software Evaluation &amp; Product Capabilities</h2>
        <p>
          Features and capabilities described on this marketing website reflect current platform architecture. Performance benchmarks, execution speeds, and automated test synthesis throughput depend upon customer environment sizing, network infrastructure, and deployed runtime configurations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">4. Enterprise Licensing &amp; Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          This website and its preview materials are provided for informational and evaluation purposes. Commercial warranties, enterprise uptime commitments, dedicated service-level agreements (SLAs), and customer support terms are governed exclusively by formal executed enterprise agreements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">5. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiries regarding enterprise licensing or legal terms should be directed to <a href="mailto:legal@veriqon.com" style="color: var(--royal-blue); text-decoration: underline;">legal@veriqon.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
